REDISTRIBUTING THE IMAGE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Publishing a container image built from this repository is redistribution of the
GPL-licensed software inside it, and carries obligations that this repository's
Apache-2.0 licence does not satisfy on your behalf.

ComfyUI, ComfyUI-UniRig and ComfyUI-Manager are pure Python and are present in
the image as source, so their corresponding source travels with the object code.

Blender's bpy is a compiled binary wheel, and its source is not in the image.
GPL-2.0-or-later permits electing version 3 and satisfying the requirement under
GPLv3 section 6(d), by offering the corresponding source from a network location
alongside the image, for as long as the image is offered. Publish that pointer
with the image.

